The recovered animal system appears to be split into several major layers:

**AnimalData**  
defines or resolves animal datablocks and preloaded type data

**Animal runtime object**  
represents the live animal entity in the world

**Animals::Manager**  
creates animals and selects their behavior tree

**Animals::SpawnControl**  
controls procedural or region-based spawning

